From aaf1da88c0e8935193fec114ac858dc4c305455d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@Averys-MacBook-Air.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 15:57:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] opengl: integrate multi-arch Metal runtime

---
